<title>SINGAPORE: City Dev, Republic Hotels win land tender.</title>
<headline>City Dev, Republic Hotels win land tender.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Developments Ltd and Republic Hotels &amp; Resorts Ltd were awarded a 24,282 sq metre plot of land for Singapore $55.5 million, the Urban Redevelopment Authority (URA) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The land parcel is located in Singapore's central business district and could be used for hotel and commercial development, the URA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
